  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/imagebitmap-and-animations.html#dom-resizequality-pixelated\r\n\r\nTaking this sprite:\r\n\r\n![mario-original](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/93594/36418210-19e5c826-1626-11e8-914d-b3bc0d8cd036.png)\r\n\r\nHere's a **nearest-neighbour** upscaling vs **bilinear** upscaling:\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/93594/36418225-26b67e1a-1626-11e8-8ab5-ba68ac81e493.png\" width=\"200\"> <img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/93594/36418249-35494c3c-1626-11e8-8cfd-199a8eb57e29.png\" width=\"200\">\r\n\r\nIt feels like an error to allow bilinear interpolation when the intent expressed is \"pixelated\".",
